[I] Virtual CCID smart card library, used by QEMU/SPICE

[T] libcacard emulates a CCID smart-card reader and a Common Access Card,
[T] letting virtual machines such as QEMU/SPICE present a smart card to the
[T] guest that is backed by a real card or an NSS software token on the host.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/spice/libcacard

[A] The SPICE Project (Red Hat, Inc.)
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/library

[L] LGPL
[V] 2.8.2

